  "paragraphs": [
    "temperature: 118 of 118 rows have known values (100.0% coverage).",
    "At k = 20, known anchor\u2013neighbor pairs differ by 0.7405 units on average. The local/global variance ratio is 0.1073 and Moran\u2019s I is 0.8892. These describe similarity of nearby values, not prediction accuracy.",
    "Known-neighbor coverage at this k is 100.0%. Unknown neighbors are excluded from agreement denominators; missing annotations can bias the result.",
    "The saved null comparison gives an empirical one-sided p-value of 0.25 for mean_neighbor_abs_difference. This tests the specified shuffle, not semantic understanding; use the combined multiple-testing table and practical effect sizes when judging the finding.",
    "The probe panel measures recoverability on a held-out split. Compare each model with its baseline; recoverability and nearest-neighbor usefulness answer different questions.",
    "baseline: mae 1.696, r2 -0.002912; 30 held-out test rows (or the macro summary of supported binary tags).",
    "linear: mae 0.03464, r2 0.9995; 30 held-out test rows (or the macro summary of supported binary tags).",
    "For paired_anchor_mean_abs_difference at k = 20, A is 0.7405 and B is 0.7368, with B\u2212A -0.003681 across 118 paired anchors. Conditional 95% interval: -0.01338 to 0.003801; lower is better for this measure. This does not rank overall embedding quality.",
    "Embedding A normalization comparison on identical held-out rows: raw_standardized: r2 0.9995, unit: r2 0.9619, unit_standardized: r2 0.9707, norm_only: r2 -0.0237. Direction-only and magnitude-only scores describe accessible information for these pipelines; fit telemetry does not establish encoder-training stability.",
    "Embedding B normalization comparison on identical held-out rows: raw_standardized: r2 0.9995, unit: r2 0.9653, unit_standardized: r2 0.9724, norm_only: r2 -0.02671. Direction-only and magnitude-only scores describe accessible information for these pipelines; fit telemetry does not establish encoder-training stability.",
    "In the raw_euclidean filtration for embedding A, the shuffled-minus-observed component variation gap exceeds 0.02 at 2 of 6 evaluated radii, across 2 sampled cohorts. This is descriptive annotation organization across correlated scales, not a topology significance test or a semantic quality grade.",
    "In the raw_euclidean filtration for embedding B, the shuffled-minus-observed component variation gap exceeds 0.02 at 2 of 6 evaluated radii, across 2 sampled cohorts. This is descriptive annotation organization across correlated scales, not a topology significance test or a semantic quality grade.",
    "In the unit_chordal filtration for embedding A, the shuffled-minus-observed component variation gap exceeds 0.02 at 2 of 6 evaluated radii, across 2 sampled cohorts. This is descriptive annotation organization across correlated scales, not a topology significance test or a semantic quality grade.",
    "In the unit_chordal filtration for embedding B, the shuffled-minus-observed component variation gap exceeds 0.02 at 2 of 6 evaluated radii, across 2 sampled cohorts. This is descriptive annotation organization across correlated scales, not a topology significance test or a semantic quality grade.",
